          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você entrega o celular a uma criança e, por hábito, abre o app Fotos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You shouldn't have to wonder who's been looking." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sie sollten nicht rätseln müssen, wer Ihre Daten angesehen hat."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No deberías tener que preguntarte quién estuvo mirando."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous ne devriez pas avoir à vous demander qui a regardé."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non dovresti chiederti chi ha guardato."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "誰かに見られたかも、と不安になる必要はありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "누가 봤는지 불안해할 필요가 없어야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você não deveria ter que se perguntar quem andou olhando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll be charged when it ends. Cancel any time in Settings if VaultBox isn't for you." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nach Ablauf wird der Preis berechnet. Wenn VaultBox nicht das Richtige für Sie ist, können Sie jederzeit in den Einstellungen kündigen."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se te cobrará al finalizar. Si VaultBox no es para ti, cancela cuando quieras en Configuración."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous serez facturé à la fin de l’essai. Si VaultBox ne vous convient pas, résiliez à tout moment dans Réglages."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al termine verrà effettuato l’addebito. Se VaultBox non fa per te, puoi annullare in qualsiasi momento da Impostazioni."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "終了後に料金が発生します。VaultBoxが合わない場合は、設定からいつでもキャンセルできます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "체험이 끝나면 요금이 청구됩니다. VaultBox가 맞지 않으면 설정에서 언제든지 해지할 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A cobrança será feita ao final. Se o VaultBox não for para você, cancele quando quiser nos Ajustes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll practise the unlock gesture next." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als Nächstes üben Sie die Entsperrgeste."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A continuación practicarás el gesto de desbloqueo."
          }
